- Never create a Git worktree in the scratchpad. Worktrees are persistent developer-visible state, so create one only when the user explicitly asks for it; when asked, put it under the project-local `.kolega/worktrees/<safe-unique-slug>` path after verifying that subtree is ignored through the shared Git `info/exclude`.
- The directory may already contain files from earlier turns of this session or from sub-agents that share it. Do not delete files you did not create.
